window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Big, bad, and purple. Indulge in some alien romance with:</p> <ul> <li><i>Heroic Abduction</i>: He’ll do anything to be her knight in purple armor.</li> <li><i>Holiday Abduction</i>: This Christmas, Jilly is hoping for a miracle, but instead she gets a hunky purple alien.</li> <li><i>Reader Abduction</i>: In a city, far, far, away, some unsuspecting readers attending a romance conference get to experience a true alien abduction.</li> <li><i>Reverse Abduction</i>: Azteriya has a dream of traveling the galaxy and exploring strange new worlds. Fighting fierce foes. Of clubbing a viable male to bring home to her mother so that her transgression is forgiven.</li> </ul>"; 
